## [Description](https://angular.dev/api/router/TitleStrategy#description)
Provides a strategy for setting the page title after a router navigation.
The built-in implementation traverses the router state snapshot and finds the deepest primary outlet with `title` property. Given the below, navigating to `/base/child(popup:aux)` would result in the document title being set to "child".
